{"seq":5,"slug":"belt-and-road-initiative","title":"一带一路","stage":"DONE","category":"xi-jinping-thought","categoryLabel":"习近平思想","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/03_xi-jinping-thought/05_belt-and-road-initiative","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"一带一路-本-hub-定位与导读\">一带一路：本 hub 定位与导读</h1><p>2013 年 9 月 7 日习近平在哈萨克斯坦纳扎尔巴耶夫大学首提&quot;丝绸之路经济带&quot;、同年 10 月 3 日在印度尼西亚国会首提&quot;21 世纪海上丝绸之路&quot;之后，&quot;一带一路&quot;从两次演讲逐步长成一套包含合作文件、多边机构、经济走廊与项目账本的国际合作体系。本 hub 专门处理<strong>倡议本身</strong>：它的提出动因、五通框架、项目实践、融资架构、发展模式外溢、真实争议与转型方向。读者读完本 hub，应当能独立回答三个问题：倡议为什么在 2013 年出现、钱和项目是怎么落地的、哪些批评经得起证据检验。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与同 category 兄弟 hub 的分工边界如下——概念本体与制度细节归兄弟 hub，本 hub 只做&quot;倡议视角&quot;的接引：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>分工边界（它负责什么）</th>\n<th>本 hub 的接点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>01_xi-jinping-thought-overview</td>\n<td>思想体系整体图谱与理论框架</td>\n<td>一带一路是体系中的对外实践板块之一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>03_chinese-dream</td>\n<td>中国梦的概念谱系与民族复兴叙事</td>\n<td>复兴叙事如何转化为国际话语资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>04_new-development-philosophy</td>\n<td>新发展理念（含开放发展）的国内本体</td>\n<td>开放发展理念的国际延伸场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>06_ecological-civilization</td>\n<td>生态文明的国内制度与治理</td>\n<td>绿色丝绸之路的国内政策源头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>07_community-shared-future</td>\n<td>命运共同体的概念与外交体系</td>\n<td>一带一路是其标志性实践平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>08_comprehensive-deepening-reform</td>\n<td>国内全面深化改革议程</td>\n<td>向西开放、区域协调的改革背景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：想快速理解&quot;倡议是什么&quot;，按 <a href=\"strategic-vision/proposal-background\">提出背景</a> → <a href=\"strategic-vision/five-connectivity\">五通</a> 顺序读第一章；想评估&quot;做得怎么样&quot;，按 <a href=\"implementation-practice/infrastructure-projects\">基础设施</a> → <a href=\"implementation-practice/trade-facilitation\">贸易</a> → <a href=\"implementation-practice/financial-cooperation\">金融</a> 读第二章，三篇分别对应项目账、贸易账、资金账；想形成自己的判断，第三章按 <a href=\"global-impact/development-model-innovation\">发展模式</a> → <a href=\"global-impact/challenges-responses\">挑战与应对</a> → <a href=\"global-impact/future-direction\">未来方向</a> 读，其中挑战篇给出证据分层方法，是全 hub 的批判性阅读支点。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：2008 年全球金融危机后世界经济格局的基本事实；中国&quot;三期叠加&quot;与产能过剩的宏观背景；国际发展融资的几个基础概念（ODA、多边开发银行、主权债务可持续性）。不需要国际关系专业训练——本 hub 各篇自带所需的概念定义与数据出处说明。</p>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读</strong>（可选的跨 hub 探索入口，本 hub 正文不依赖这些链接）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../community-shared-future/\">人类命运共同体</a>：一带一路所服务的顶层外交概念</li>\n<li><a href=\"../new-development-philosophy/\">新发展理念</a>：开放发展理念的国内本体</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ecological-civilization/\">生态文明建设</a>：绿色丝绸之路的国内政策源头</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"strategic-vision","title":"战略构想","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/strategic-vision","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"proposal-background","title":"\"一带一路\"的提出背景与时代动因","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/strategic-vision/proposal-background"},{"seq":2,"slug":"silk-road-spirit","title":"丝路精神：一个历史概念的当代转译","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/strategic-vision/silk-road-spirit"},{"seq":3,"slug":"five-connectivity","title":"五通：一个有依赖顺序的合作操作系统","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/strategic-vision/five-connectivity"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation-practice","title":"实施实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"infrastructure-projects","title":"基础设施项目：从走廊骨架到项目账本","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice/infrastructure-projects"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trade-facilitation","title":"贸易便利化：把时间从成本表里减掉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice/trade-facilitation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"financial-cooperation","title":"金融合作：三层资金架构与债务方程","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice/financial-cooperation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-impact","title":"全球影响","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/global-impact","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"development-model-innovation","title":"发展模式创新：基建先行的替代路径及其边界","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/global-impact/development-model-innovation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"challenges-responses","title":"挑战与应对：证据分层下的争议地图","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/global-impact/challenges-responses"},{"seq":3,"slug":"future-direction","title":"未来方向：从大写意到工笔画的路线图","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/global-impact/future-direction"}]}]}